    "O": 0.0,
    "source": "1790 and 1800 census interpolated to 1796, women 21+ (estimated from age bands). No woman could vote for president this year: New Jersey's propertied women could vote in state elections, but its legislature chose the electors this year. Turnout is zero by law, not by estimate."
   },
   {
    "key": "south-white",
